# The Kono-Ha kernel Image (30MB) is not committed. crdroid_onyx_patches/apply.sh
# downloads it from the konoha-kernel-gki release and drops it at
# vendor/extra/kernel/onyx/Image, which is where BoardConfigKernel.mk's
# PRODUCT_COPY_FILES substitution expects it. BoardConfigKernel.mk hard-$(error)s
# if it is missing, so a forgotten apply.sh fails the build instead of silently
# shipping crDroid's kernel.
kernel/
